message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below. Status: simulation study; the three frozen experiments (protocol v1.1) are complete; the manuscript is an independent research manuscript / preprint draft, not peer-reviewed. Simulated learners are not human participants. An AI system (Claude, Anthropic) was used as a research and development assistant; it is not an author."
